0" end="00:43.580">realize</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.610" end="00:46.940"><span begin="00:43.610" end="00:43.880">If </span><span begin="00:43.880" end="00:44.150">you </span><span begin="00:44.150" end="00:44.690">ask </span><span begin="00:44.690" end="00:45.230">me </span><span begin="00:45.230" end="00:45.560">how </span><span begin="00:45.560" end="00:45.710">I'm </span><span begin="00:45.710" end="00:46.940">doing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.970" end="00:50.270"><span begin="00:46.970" end="00:47.160">I </span><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.370">would </span><span begin="00:47.370" end="00:47.900">say </span><span begin="00:47.900" end="00:48.230">I'm </span><span begin="00:48.230" end="00:48.710">doing </span><span begin="00:48.710" end="00:49.070">just </span><span begin="00:49.070" end="00:50.270">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.300" end="00:56.960"><span begin="00:50.300" end="00:50.540">I </span><span begin="00:50.540" end="00:50.720">would </span><span begin="00:50.720" end="00:51.410">lie </span><span begin="00:51.410" end="00:51.530">and </span><span begin="00:51.530" end="00:52.190">say </span><span begin="00:52.190" end="00:52.490">that </span><span begin="00:52.490" end="00:53.060">you're </span><span begin="00:53.060" end="00:53.420">not </span><span begin="00:53.420" end="00:53.930">on </span><span begin="00:53.930" end="00:54.140">my </span><span begin="00:54.140" end="00:56.960">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.990" end="01:03.740"><span begin="00:56.990" end="00:57.380">But </span><span begin="00:57.380" end="00:57.530">I </span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:58.250">go </span><span begin="00:58.250" end="00:58.820">out </span><span begin="00:58.820" end="00:59.060">and </span><span begin="00:59.060" end="00:59.150">I </span><span begin="00:59.150" end="00:59.630">sit </span><span begin="00:59.630" end="01:00.410">down </span><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:00.740">at </span><span begi